# The wait routine of actor kind $6D ($83:EF92) for variant $1C (bits 2-4
# of $07, $83:EFBC), which no script's play meets: it is downed by a shot
# ($83:EFD1), and it ends itself 144 pixels or more from the point actors
# are kept in range of ($83:EFEC). On pw3.state the actor at $0B5B given
# variant $1C and moved 256 pixels away, and the frames after it; then on
# the first level played as unit_pot_hit.box until an apple is thrown, a
# unit call of the routine on the falling pot's record ($0C4B) given
# variant $1C, with the apple moved onto it as there and the point on it.
load build/aladdin/states/pw3.state
wait 2
poke $000B62 1C
poke $000B67 9C,03
wait 5
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
hold B 76
hold RIGHT 36
hold DOWN 64
hold B+RIGHT 16
hold R 59
hold RIGHT 61
hold B+LEFT 79
hold Y+RIGHT 7
hold L 73
press START
wait 60
press START
hold R 31
hold RIGHT 71
hold DOWN 67
hold Y+RIGHT+B 33
hold DOWN 41
hold B+R 75
hold LEFT 27
hold A+RIGHT 19
hold DOWN+A 58
hold B+RIGHT 42
hold UP 68
hold RIGHT 65
hold R 57
hold Y+RIGHT+B 74
hold Y+RIGHT+B 15
hold DOWN+A 17
hold DOWN+A 54
hold RIGHT 64
hold X 79
hold L 25
hold B+LEFT 5
hold UP+B 74
hold DOWN+A 48
hold Y+LEFT 49
hold A 88
hold RIGHT 53
hold DOWN+A 20
hold UP+B 30
hold RIGHT 65
press A 2
wait 4
set 0009D7 92,02
set 0009DA 06,01
set $000C52 1C
set $001A44 92,02,06,01
call 83EF92 d=0C4B db=80 p=30
